{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、日本武道館で行われた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寺岡呼人 presents Golden Circle 第20回\n記念スペシャル ～僕と桜井和寿のメロディー～\nライブで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のきっかけのカバーを\nしてくださったとお聞きしました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井さんが\nすごくいい曲なんだと言ってくださってることを聞いて、本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に小さい頃から\n親の影響で\nMr.Childrenさんの曲を聞いて育ってきて\n家族みんな好きなアーティストさんなので\n今回こうやって乃木坂46の1曲を\nカバーして頂けたことを幸せに思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も聞きたかったよー！！！\n乃木坂のファンの方でライブを見たって方もいらっしゃるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"羨ましいです。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、家族を\nMr.Childrenさんのライブに\n連れて行くのも1つの夢で\nその時が楽しみです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日、Mr.Childrenさんの桜井さんの歌う曲をきいて頑張ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も誰かの力になれる\n誰かの励みになれるような\nアイドルになれるようにがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/6592335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から千葉のある場所で\n撮影でしたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また解禁されたら話します♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとにひめちゃんと2人で\nSamurai ELOさんの撮影がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ポーズあって\nボーイッシュなスタイルで\n道の真ん中で撮影だったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売は7月24日です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も朝から\n楽しみな撮影です♡がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに嬉しい報告ができるように\nがんばるぞー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/6592335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/6592335/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBさん 発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10代最後のUTBさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/6592335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は急な夕立ちだったり\n気温の差が激しかったりで\n身体がついてかないよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは体調大丈夫ですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期に快適な地ってどこなんだろう。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道かえりたいよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もツアー終わりに北海道に帰れるように\nツアーがんばらないと！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに！初めて選抜メンバーとしての\n夏のツアーだし！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えることがたくさんで大変だけど\nきっと去年の私よりも\n何倍も何十倍も成長した姿を\n見せられると思います！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱い夏にするぞ～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね、各地のご当地グルメのはなしで\nメンバーとスタッフさんと盛り上がってるよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐふふふふ(｡・・｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/6592335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/6592335/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若しゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/06/6592335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}